    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭlerda</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				city in</i> Hispania Tarraconensis, <i>on the
